<div class="callout">
  <p><strong>Straight up: these are demos, not client work.</strong> The businesses below are fictional, the phone numbers don't ring, and nothing here is presented as a past client — we're new, and pretending otherwise would insult your intelligence. What's real is the build itself: the structure, the copy, the speed, the way it works on a phone. Judge the work, then picture your name on it.</p>
